# CollabBoard Project Context

This project is **CollabBoard**: a real-time collaborative whiteboard (G4 Week 1). Requirements and stack are fixed; use them when implementing or discussing features.

## Where to read details

- **Requirements (MVP, Core, AI agent, submission):** `docs/requirements.md`
- **Pre-Search (stack, deploy, AI model, cost):** `docs/presearch.md`
- **Current status and implementation plan:** `STATUS_AND_PLAN.md` (in repo root)

## Stack (do not change without reason)

- **Deploy:** Vercel
- **Auth:** Firebase Auth (Google sign-in)
- **Data:** Firestore (board objects) + Realtime DB (cursors)
- **Frontend:** React + Konva.js (react-konva)
- **AI agent:** Claude 4.5 Sonnet, function calling, &lt;2s response

## When adding features

- Align with `docs/requirements.md` (shapes: rect/circle/line; connectors; transforms; AI tool schema).
- Pre-Search doc is the source of truth for stack and cost; keep `STATUS_AND_PLAN.md` updated as work progresses.
